  "body": "Publish the source-bound November 18–20 supplements (7, 10 and 8 papers), substantive November 21–23 status bulletins, four separately labeled historical additions, and W47. All date reviews are merged with exact-head CI, owner and content receipts; November 23 is the actual review date. The initial November 18 not-ready snapshot and October 27 withdrawal remain archived.\n\nAll 12 sources were attempted, including six complete HF boards. The 234 new canonical records received 29 inclusion decisions (25 daily + 4 historical), 202 exclusions and 3 specific evidence deferrals. Semantic Scholar coverage remains partial after rate limits. The 9,292-ID ledger preserves individual reasons, 2,096 historical version tasks and 41 model errors. Two old HF metadata receipts and two v2 wording corrections are separate from new-paper counts.\n\nValidation: repository validation passes; two builds produce identical bytes across 518 public artifacts. The independent content check matched all 29 bilingual summaries, dates and 89 source quotations; the two v2 cards were separately checked. Historical global recall remains 0.892857 against 0.90 and is not reported as passing. No paid generation requests or tokens were used. Pages and public byte verification are still required after merge.\n",
